title: Neural Extremal Graph Search
message: If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: Neural Extremal Graph Search contributors
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark for testing whether a permutation-equivariant graph
  neural network can learn and extrapolate the Turan construction of dense
  triangle-free graphs.
keywords:
  - extremal graph theory
  - graph neural networks
  - Turan theorem
  - size generalization
